rmation and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Order of Adjectives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you use two or more adjectives, the order of the adjectives depends on the category of adjective. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Category\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"opinion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beautiful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shape\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"round\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"age\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"old\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"color\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gilded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nationality\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Russian\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"material\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"wooden\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">It was a beautiful old Russian tower.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">They went into a tall red brick building.</span>", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking Someone to Speak Slowly", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you ask someone to speak slowly, it is important to be polite.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking Someone to Speak Slowly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Speak slowly, please, Miss/Sir.<br> Much slower please, Miss/Sir.<br> Again, slower please, Miss/Sir.<br> Would you mind speaking slower?<br> You speak very fast/quickly. Could you slow down, please?<br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Excuse me, Sir. Would you mind speaking slower?</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Please speak slower, Miss.</span>", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "selfie", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a picture you take of yourself", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She took a selfie with the tour guide.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you are on a guided tour.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "the outside world", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place you do not visit often", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The tsars in the Kremlin rarely saw the outside world. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hand", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the long or short arm on a clock face  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The hands on the clock were gold! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Roman numerals", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the number system used in ancient Rome ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The clock had large Roman numerals on the face. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fancy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "elaborate; ornate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The gold clock was too fancy for his home.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find out what the weather is like in Moscow in the fall.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out what clothing people wear for the weather. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of clothing you need to travel there.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say what items you have and what you need to buy.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk over your list with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I look up the weather in Moscow.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make a list of clothing to wear for the weather.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss the list with a partner. ", "type": "text"}]}]}